# ~/.ghl/agencies/<agency>.env  — ONE Firebase refresh token per agency.
# Copy this to ~/.ghl/agencies/<agency>.env, paste the token, then `chmod 600` it.
# Every profile with GHL_AGENCY=<agency> shares this token automatically.
#
# Grab the token by hand from DevTools while logged into THAT agency:
#   Application tab -> Storage -> IndexedDB -> firebaseLocalStorageDb
#   -> firebaseLocalStorage -> value -> stsTokenManager -> refreshToken
# Full walkthrough: docs/get-firebase-token.md

GHL_FIREBASE_REFRESH_TOKEN=AMf-...paste here...
